{"title":"2018 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2019 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/c/7cc5a2582a89d60f769a5c2ec55d2d7ddb08c6b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"12\" height=\"33\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/0/1a0d34aaea55167c857d54b2f9251a9146bdd4be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6}{18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"38\" /> = 1, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By simplification:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/c/a1c5b16c3bebd82956704ec605c30888384f9ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3a}{18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"25\" height=\"38\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/0/1a0d34aaea55167c857d54b2f9251a9146bdd4be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6}{18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"38\" /> = 1\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/1/1f103b5231b5390a56b40f4e60697db50bd4031a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3a+6}{18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"52\" height=\"38\" /> = 1\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c72fb6667542f09b028d522f8794b929fa3ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a + 6 = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"92\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/6/486f903982e5d0ca67aa5102553d949fc30e3c78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/6/516f8f945c64a5d895f8a9729a52eb9aab8203f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\boxed{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"56\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~originally by North America Math Contest Go Go Go and modified by anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018005230\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 43/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1629/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.166      1 2018_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    6.166      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35934:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018005230 and